{"id":"puxa","lemma":"puxa","pos":"intj","rank":1360,"glosses":["expresses surprise or admiration","expresses disappointment"],"ipa":"/ˈpu.ʃɐ/","examples":[{"text":"Uma coisa puxa a outra.","en":"One thing leads to another.","words":[{"g":"a","l":"um"},{"g":"thing"},null,{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"other one","l":"outro"}]},{"text":"Eu sei quem puxa as cordas.","en":"I know who pulls the strings.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be aware, to know","l":"saber"},{"g":"who"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"rope, string","l":"corda"}]},{"text":"Puxa, eu bem que gostaria de ter esse problema.","en":"Gee, I wish I had that problem.","words":[null,{"g":"I"},null,null,{"g":"to like","l":"gostar"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to own"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"problem"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"potentially"]]},{"text":"Puxa! Essa foi quase!","en":"Phew! That was close!","words":[null,{"g":"that, that one","l":"esse"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"almost"}]}]}